From: Nicholas Piggin <npiggin@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Mar 2026 00:13:43 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] tests/tcg/riscv64: Add vector state to signal test

Signed-off-by: Nicholas Piggin <npiggin@gmail.com>
---
 tests/tcg/riscv64/Makefile.target        |   4 +-
 tests/tcg/riscv64/test-signal-handling.c | 226 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 222 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

Ubuntu-Bug: https://bugs.launchpad.net/ubuntu/+bug/2133188
Forwarded: https://lore.kernel.org/all/20260321141345.599105-1-npiggin@gmail.com/

